this project's branding.

Code comments cite upstream issues as "upstream#N". These refer to
issue N in https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent, not to this
project's issue tracker.

The web dashboard depends on the third-party npm package
"@nous-research/ui", published by Nous Research. It is an ordinary
dependency; the package name is theirs, not a claim of affiliation.

The science skills in skills/science/ are derived from Claude Science
(Anthropic), used under the Apache License 2.0. They have been modified
for opencodon; each skill's metadata.provenance block records the
upstream version and what was changed.

Those skills reference third-party models, datasets and services that
opencodon does not redistribute. Model weights are fetched by the user's
own environment from their original sources and remain subject to their
own licenses; each skill's metadata.third_party block names them and
links their terms.
